@baseUrl = http://localhost:5066

### 1. Sign in as Academic Supervisor
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/account/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

Username=academic.supervisor&Password=Demo-Supervisor-Password

### 2. Access protected Students Enrolments API without role permission (Expect 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/S100001/enrolments
Accept: application/json
